  "bodyHash": "ABTUIxyp4BI=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可重生動物</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">將基岩版的動物生成機制帶入 Java 版。動物不再於世界生成後永遠存在，而是可以在遠處自然消失，並在活躍玩家周圍重新繁衍，就像基岩版中的被動生物一樣。🐄</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這讓世界保持生機，並防止區域在探索或狩獵後永久失去動物。無論你是收集資源、飼養牲畜，還是單純旅行，野生動物都能隨著時間自然回歸。🌿</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">玩家關心的動物會受到保護。被馴服、繁殖、命名、騎乘或其他與玩家互動過的動物會留在原位，確保寵物和牲畜永不消失。🐕</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基岩版一致性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓 Java 版的動物生成行為更接近基岩版。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">動物自然重生：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">野生動物在遠處時可消失，並隨著時間在玩家周圍重新繁衍。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不再永久耗盡：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">狩獵或清除某一區域的動物不再使其永久空無一物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏗️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支援可再生動物族群：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">創造一致的生成行為，為新的養殖與自動化作法提供可能性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐕 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">保護玩家動物：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">被馴服、繁殖、命名、騎乘或其他互動過的動物會自動變為永久存在。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">簡便世界設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過一小組世界專屬遊戲規則調整生成行為。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需在伺服器端安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組透過 Minecraft 的 </span><a href=\"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Game_rule\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">遊戲規則</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">進行設定，讓每個世界可以獨立調整設定，無需編輯檔案。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細文件、設定範例以及所有可用選項的完整參考，請參閱 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/b3spectacled\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">B3spectacled</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以他的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-spawns\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Custom Spawns</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了本專案的構想。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/completionists-index\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/completionistsindex/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/respawninganimals/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
